{"id": 8877403177158, "title": "Momcozy V3 Double Electric Breast Pump", "body_html": "<div>\n<div class=\"NewMessageContextMenuTrigger MessageContextMenuTrigger MessageContextMenuTrigger--scene-chat message-section-left is-reply message-section-newFileCard\" id=\"7688302815239752983\">\n<div class=\"MessageActionPermissionWrapper\">\n<div class=\"message-content-container\">\n<div class=\"catch-resize-observer-dom message-content\">\n<div role=\"text-message\" class=\"MessageActionPermissionWrapper message-text\">\n<div class=\"limit-height-container\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\">A good pumping journey starts with the right support.</span></strong><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\">V3 is a new-generation primary breast pump designed to support moms from the very beginning, bringing together dependable dual-motor performance, personalized comfort, and intelligent control in one everyday system.</span><span class=\"text-only\"> </span><span class=\"text-only\">With strong, steady suction up to 300 mmHg per side and independent control for each side, V3 adapts to the way your body responds. Gentle starts, baby-inspired rhythms, and streamlined hands-free collectors make pumping easier to get into, more comfortable to settle into, and simpler to manage day after day.</span><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\"></span><br>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\">HOSPITAL-STRENGTH DUAL-MOTOR POWER</span></strong><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\">Dual motors deliver strong, consistent suction up to 300 mmHg per side for dependable pumping performance, session after session.</span><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\"></span></strong><br>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\">PERSONALIZED COMFORT FOR EACH SIDE</span></strong><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\"><span class=\"text-only\">Adjust suction independently on the left and right, while SoftStart gradually ramps to your selected level and DoubleFit™ flanges provide a soft, secure fit. </span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\"></span><br>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\">EXPERT-GUIDED PUMPING EXPERIENCE</span></strong><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\"><span class=\"text-only\">One-tap expert programs pair with baby-inspired suckling patterns to support a more natural, comfortable pumping rhythm with less guesswork. </span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\"></span><br>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\">INTELLIGENT CONTROL AT A GLANCE</span></strong><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\"><span class=\"text-only\">A 1.8-inch color display and app connectivity make it easy to check status, adjust settings, and stay in control throughout each session. </span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\"></span><br>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<strong><span class=\"text-only\">EASY TO USE, EASY TO CLEAN</span></strong><span class=\"text-only\"> </span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\"><span class=\"text-only\">3-part wearable collectors simplify setup and cleanup, making everyday pumping easier to fit into your routine.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"message-reactions\">\n<div class=\"reaction-item\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Breast Pump", "created_at": "2026-05-12T22:38:08-04:00", "handle": "v3-double-electric-breast-pump", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:00-04:00", "published_at": "2026-09-23T00:29:19-04:00", "template_suffix": "v3-brand-pdp", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, V3, 吸奶器, 吸奶器主机主链", "variants": [{"id": 47537152852166, "product_id": 8877403177158, "title": "Cloud White", "price": "249.99", "sku": "BP431-WH70000N10101-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "249.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Cloud White", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2026-09-21T05:43:27-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:00-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "528188895299", "grams": 0, "image_id": 44143733440710, "weight": 0.0, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}, {"id": 47537152884934, "product_id": 8877403177158, "title": "Warm Gray", "price": "249.99", "sku": "BP431-GR70000N10101-A", "position": 2, "compare_at_price": "249.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": "shopify", "option1": "Warm Gray", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2026-09-21T05:43:27-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:00-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": null, "grams": 0, "image_id": 44143745597638, "weight": 